SUMMARY:Credit and Debt Management
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T193000
UID:69f22bc1bd9a3c316a563942@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by\nRiverdale Immigrant Women’s Centre (RIWC)\n\, 
 this workshop will provide details to help better understand credit scores
 \, responsible borrowing\, and effective ways to reduce and manage debt.\n
 Registration encouraged\n. Drop-ins are welcome until capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 1\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f22bc1bd9a3c316a563942
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
