DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T173000
UID:699cd464491b809c6f1bee1f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Coach Desiree McKenzie guides participants through an explorat
 ion of rap music as poetry in motion. Participants will analyze lyrics and
  create their own original spoken word pieces inspired by musical flow and
  technique.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699cd464491b809c6f1bee1f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
