BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toronto Games Week: An Intro to DaggerHeart
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T200000
UID:69d6a557c1cf6f9a758407d1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Toronto Games Week (June 11 - Jun 17) come l
 earn the ins and outs of the Tabletop Roleplaying phenomenon known as Dagg
 erHeart.\nPlayers will fall into the roles of our heroic adventurers and p
 rove they have the strength\, skills\, knowledge and bravery to become the
  Games Week Champions!\nNo prior Tabletop Roleplaying experience required!
  Come with an open mind and an open heart!\n(Program intended for a mature
  audience.)\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on t
 his form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libra
 ries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only b
 e used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Quest
 ions about how the library handles your information can be directed to Ans
 werline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, 
 Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Port Union\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d6a557c1cf6f9a758407d1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
