UID:69e117dabd5c392c7644a51b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This is a 2-part series\, participants are expected to attend 
 both sessions.\nPython is an open source programming language that is used
  for creating web applications\, web content\, mathematics and system scri
 pting. In this course you will learn how python code works and given time 
