DESCRIPTION:Calling all teen artist!  Unleash your creativity and join ou
 r Teen Art Club.  Come create\, paint\, and craft with us.\nDrop in.\nMay
  4:  Mother's Day Card Crafting\nMay 11:  Cherry Blossom Q-tip Painting\
 nMay 25:  Shrinky Dinks
