DESCRIPTION:Create your own personalized glass magnets. Perfect for decora
 ting your locker or fridge at home or to give as a gift. Drop-in\, no regi
 stration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs 
 are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where hel
 pful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered dai
 ly. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out mo
