 e birds you are likely to find. Find out about clubs and field trips\, bir
 ding ethics\, and protection and conservation efforts. Presented by Monika
  Croydon\, a member of the Toronto Ornithological Club.\nThis program is 
 for adults and older children. Drop-in\, no registration necessary.
