 chnology 3D design and printing.\nThis is an in-person event\, registratio
 n required via Eventbrite two weeks before. For safety reason\, no child u
 nder 6 years old allowed in this program. Children 6-12 years old should a
 ccompany an adult.\nLimited drop-in spots available.\nPlease be noted that
  your spot will be taken by others if you failed to show up 5 mins after c
 lass begins.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on 
